@node "menu" "ByTeR¡DeRs - Coders Paradise"
@toc "menu"

        Did you ever wonder where you can get in contact with a lot
        of coders and cool scene people, not the usual scum lurking
                      around on all the other BBS´s?
            Did you ever had the opportunity to rummage through
          an arsenal of 50+ Megs of Docs/Coding-Hints/Solutions?
     Ever desperately looked for some way old game that wasn´t online
                   anymore at all those "elite" boards?
  Did you ever wanted to have all those nice /X tools that were floating
   around over the year, and you did not dare to install them in fear of
                                backdoors?
         Ever had the feeling that everyone is able to BB but you?
   Did you ever wanted to know where all those nice little programs are
          tested before they get released weeks and months later?
  Did you ever wonder where you can find all the new Public Domain stuff?
 
            Well, this BBS is the answer to all these problems.

              There is just one tiny little drawback for you:

            Question: "How do I get the number?"
            Answer:   "You don´t. If we feel you belong here, 
                       we will invite you."

@endnode
